ship and sacrifice as well as rites, magic, magical authority, mythology, and other rituality. This situation was conducive to the creation of an attitude of give and take among the co-existing religions, as a necessity of survival.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 878, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 754})
